# Local-only settings. Copy to .env, which is gitignored and loaded by `astro dev` / `astro build`.
# Nothing secret belongs in this repo: private contact details go in contact.local.json
# (also gitignored) and are sealed with `npm run seal-contact` (see README.md).

# Include `draft: true` entries in dev and local builds so you can preview them.
# Never set this on Netlify or in CI, or drafts get published.
# SHOW_DRAFTS=1
